    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have Immunity to the &amp;Reference[Charmed] and &amp;Reference[Frightened] conditions while your Rage is active. If you're Charmed or Frightened when you enter your Rage, the condition ends on you.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-CnCRD0Dyvx4FFGfV\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes an Active Effect which grants the Charmed and Frightened condition immunity. It is not applied automatically when you begin your Rage though.</p></section>",
